1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
A clearer business setup
Udyam Digital helps a small business choose a useful digital

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
setup, verify its documents and follow progress in one place.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Gemini, with permission
With separate permission, Gemini asks about the business.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Here, the owner describes a clinic with eight staff at one location.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Needs and budget
The owner adds current tools, service goals and a six-thousand-rupee monthly budget.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Gemini interprets the request, while counts and budget remain reviewable.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
A validated recommendation
Gemini proposes products for every requested goal.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,000
The server checks eligibility, dependencies and quantities, then calculates the clinic’s tax-inclusive quote.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Every change has a price
Adding one email user changes the monthly bill immediately.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Setup charges and the first invoice stay visible, and the owner can edit the plan.

11
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,000
KYC permission and registry
KYC starts with its own consent.

12
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:24,000
The demo business is checked against the supplied synthetic GST registry; no live government request is made.

13
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Actual local OCR
These specimen buttons run real local OCR on document images.

14
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:38,000
The app extracts fields and compares business names, addresses, dates and registry status.

15
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Exceptions stay visible
The cancelled K01 registration creates a visible problem.

16
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Matching K02 evidence restores readiness for partner review. OCR does not certify authenticity.

17
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Review before reservation
The owner reviews the monthly bill, setup charge and first invoice.

18
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:06,000
This demo creates no payment or contract; it saves the plan for review.

19
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Recorded partner actions
A partner records the review, installation date and simulated completion.

20
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Each transition requires a note and updates the same order history.

21
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Progress survives a reload
The owner sees what is complete and what comes next.

22
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Reloading preserves the order and recorded milestones, replacing repeated status-chasing calls.

23
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Phone experience and evidence
The website supports phone layouts and Hindi.

24
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:48,000
The partner desk analyses five thousand synthetic leads and helps select an evidence-based pilot.
